# Robot (berry)

- **Hostname:** berry
- **IP:** `192.168.1.170`
- **Config:** `yahboom/robot_config.py` → `DEFAULT_ROBOT_IP`

When giving Pi/Mac commands, use `192.168.1.170` unless the user says otherwise.
Pi runs `yahboom.host` only; Mac runs teleop, `camera.debug_vision`, and `camera.play`.
